start="1996-06-01", end="2024-06-30", same_as_paper=True, missing=0, extra=0, differences="", not_rebuilt={}
Description itself admits truncation: f"CVS daily 2019-07-01..2024-06-30 prices, returns {rets_cvs_daily.index[0].date()}..{rets_cvs_daily.index[-1].date()} n={n_cvs}" which contradicts same_as_paper=True/missing=0 and start/end. Data used does not cover paper period and report does not match data used.
